    narr:narration """This position holds two decisions on the late-sailing timetable: [the weekday last ferry pulls back from 22:40 to 21:55 from November, on ridership under ten a night](narr:Expr_20261009_4_Batch4FerryFrontmatter20261009041528_hf592dd2b25e2_1), while [the weekend timetable stays untouched, with Friday and Saturday late sailings still filling](narr:Expr_20261009_4_Batch4FerryFrontmatter20261009041528_hf592dd2b25e2_2). Both members are voiced as settled decisions argued on demand numbers.""" ;
